    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16102" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσαρκ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without flesh, lean,</i>
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρκώδης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				867b34
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.474
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.11.1
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); <i>bare of flesh,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστᾶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					1205
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέττιξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.264
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>): 
				Comp.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.101
			</span></i> (Marc. Arg). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not consisting in flesh,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίαιτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					464
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-</span> copul.) <i>fleshy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				154
			</span></i>.</div>
